{
  "name": "Speed to lead: instant email, SMS and Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Speed to lead: instant email, SMS and Slack\n\n**What it does**\nThe moment a new lead arrives, three things happen in parallel: the lead gets a personal confirmation email, your sales rep gets a text message with the lead's details, and the team gets a Slack post. Total time from form submit to SMS is usually a few seconds.\n\n**You need**\nGmail, Twilio and Slack credentials, and a Twilio number that can send SMS.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Connect your credentials.\n2. Fill in the yellow notes: sales rep phone, Twilio number, email text, Slack channel.\n3. Send your leads (form, landing page, Zapier, anything that can POST JSON) to the Production URL of **New lead received** and activate.\n\nEach alert is set to continue on error, so one failing channel never blocks the other two.\n\nBuilt by AI Strike Force, aistrikeforce.com",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 580
      },
      "id": "fdcb354c-099b-5841-b65e-4554ad503b37",
      "name": "Speed to lead: instant email, SMS and Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me\n**Text the sales rep**: set *From* to your Twilio number and *To* to the rep's mobile (E.164, like +15555550123).\n**Email the lead**: write it in your own voice.\n**Post in Slack**: pick your channel.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "a759a833-437d-5fdb-a786-e2bfee2094f5",
      "name": "Edit me: who gets alerted",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "new-lead",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "83e03089-2b9e-5681-b79e-4dc2817ac529",
      "name": "New lead received",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "c1685a66-b636-5c02-aef8-588904b14e91"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "6a907396-934c-573c-a313-9b27835b647f",
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body.name || '').trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4f4707df-4945-5bbb-89e5-5c8171b272c5",
              "name": "first_name",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body.name || 'there').trim().split(' ')[0] }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "2f24daef-6ecc-5030-bb94-a99db22bbfc4",
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body.email || '').trim().toLowerCase() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "2795ee3a-c40d-576e-8b16-866ee8d4c012",
              "name": "phone",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body.phone || '').trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "34cf09b7-c81e-5c04-aa9d-fdf40dbaf3cf",
              "name": "interest",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.interest || $json.body.message || 'not specified' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "12bd6151-e54e-5bd8-853a-eef783db32e5",
              "name": "source",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.source || 'website' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cdd20d35-25a6-567a-8ae1-0a549a2d9ead",
              "name": "received_at",
              "value": "={{ $now.toFormat('HH:mm') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "524aab28-5882-549e-bd39-c74e2f8b1442",
      "name": "Normalize lead fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "{\n  \"ok\": true\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5d91a0da-4c54-5299-818f-f3be4dfbaa43",
      "name": "Confirm receipt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "=Got it, {{ $json.first_name }}. We will call you shortly",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $json.first_name }},\n\nThanks for your request. A real person on our team has it right now and will call you within the next few minutes during business hours.\n\nIf you would rather pick a time yourself, use this link:\nhttps://cal.com/your-company/intro\n\nSpeak soon,\nYour Name\nYour Company",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "53a6b23f-e15b-5409-bc59-79723e8378af",
      "name": "Email the lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        120
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "from": "+15555550123",
        "to": "+15555550124",
        "message": "=New lead {{ $json.received_at }}: {{ $json.name || 'no name' }}\nPhone: {{ $json.phone || 'n/a' }}\nWants: {{ $json.interest }}\nSource: {{ $json.source }}\nCall within 5 minutes.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b5ee3c7c-4909-574c-8290-0a0802f6e1ec",
      "name": "Text the sales rep",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.twilio",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "twilioApi": {
          "name": "Twilio account"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#sales",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=:zap: New lead at {{ $json.received_at }}: *{{ $json.name || 'no name' }}*\nEmail: {{ $json.email || 'n/a' }} | Phone: {{ $json.phone || 'n/a' }}\nWants: {{ $json.interest }} | Source: {{ $json.source }}\nThe lead has been emailed and the rep has been texted.",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "c6668c47-5f8d-50c8-9cd5-7d93d8341117",
      "name": "Post in Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
